      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel cooled eggs and cut into large chunks.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a skillet over medium heat. Fry egg chunks in melted butter until golden brown, about 2 minutes; season with salt and pepper.",
